{"seq":11,"slug":"compiler-theory","title":"编译原理与语言理论","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":5,"docCount":18,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.42,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 编译原理与语言理论 简介\n\n编译原理是计算机科学中最具理论深度的领域之一。它研究的是如何将人类可读的高级语言系统地转换为机器可执行的低级指令，这一过程涉及形式语言、自动机理论、类型系统、程序分析与代码优化等多个核心主题。理解编译原理，不仅有助于编写更高效的代码，也能让你深刻理解编程语言的设计哲学与实现机制。\n\n本手册面向有一定编程经验的软件开发者，尤其适合希望理解语言工具链内部原理、参与语言或工具开发、或在面试中应对编译相关问题的工程师。你不需要具备编译器开发经验，但需要熟悉至少一门编程语言的基本语法和数据结构知识。\n\n全书共分为五个章节，建议按照顺序依次学习：\n\n第一章**形式语言与自动机**从理论基础出发，介绍形式文法、正则语言、上下文无关语言和图灵机等核心概念。这些理论是词法分析与语法分析的数学基石，理解它们能帮助你把握编译器各阶段的能力边界。\n\n第二章**词法分析**讲解编译器的第一个实际阶段——如何将源代码字符流切分为有意义的词法单元。本章涵盖分词原理、正则引擎的实现机制以及词法生成器的使用方法。\n\n第三章**语法分析**探讨如何根据文法规则将词法单元序列组织为结构化的语法树。本章涵盖自顶向下与自底向上两大类解析策略、解析器生成器的使用，以及抽象语法树的设计原则。\n\n第四章**语义分析与类型系统**聚焦于程序含义的静态检查。本章介绍类型系统的设计与分类、类型推导算法、作用域规则与名称绑定机制，帮助你理解编译器如何在运行前发现程序错误。\n\n第五章**代码生成与优化**涵盖编译器后端的核心工作，包括中间表示的设计、优化遍的常见策略、寄存器分配算法以及目标代码的最终生成。这是将抽象程序转化为高效机器指令的关键环节。\n\n推荐的学习路径是从第一章的理论基础开始，逐步深入到各个实际阶段。前三章构成编译器前端的完整链路，第四章承上启下连接语法与语义，第五章则完成从源码到机器码的最后一步。如果你对某个阶段有特定兴趣，也可以在掌握前置知识后直接跳转到对应章节。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"language-theory","title":"形式语言与自动机","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/language-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"formal-grammars","title":"形式文法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/language-theory/formal-grammars"},{"seq":2,"slug":"regular-languages","title":"正则语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/language-theory/regular-languages"},{"seq":3,"slug":"context-free-languages","title":"上下文无关语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/language-theory/context-free-languages"},{"seq":4,"slug":"turing-machines","title":"图灵机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/language-theory/turing-machines"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"lexical-analysis","title":"词法分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/lexical-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tokenization","title":"词法分析与分词","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/lexical-analysis/tokenization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"regex-engines","title":"正则引擎实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/lexical-analysis/regex-engines"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lexer-generators","title":"词法生成器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/lexical-analysis/lexer-generators"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"parsing","title":"语法分析","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/parsing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"top-down-parsing","title":"自顶向下解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/parsing/top-down-parsing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bottom-up-parsing","title":"自底向上解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/parsing/bottom-up-parsing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"parser-generators","title":"解析器生成器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/parsing/parser-generators"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ast-design","title":"抽象语法树设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/parsing/ast-design"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"semantic-analysis","title":"语义分析与类型系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/semantic-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"type-systems","title":"类型系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/semantic-analysis/type-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"type-inference","title":"类型推导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/semantic-analysis/type-inference"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scope-and-binding","title":"作用域与名字绑定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/semantic-analysis/scope-and-binding"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"code-generation","title":"代码生成与优化","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/code-generation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ir-design","title":"中间表示设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/code-generation/ir-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"optimization-passes","title":"优化遍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/code-generation/optimization-passes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"register-allocation","title":"寄存器分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/code-generation/register-allocation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"codegen-backend","title":"代码生成后端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/code-generation/codegen-backend"}]}]}